SJc6lnAvf","user":{"login":"RoyBerardo","id":32561682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTYxNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32561682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyBerardo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T11:50:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T11:50:24Z","body":"Made some pretty big optimizations to this, thanks to some good suggestions from a friend. I did a test with a lot of AudioStreams all playing at once. It had 128 AudioStreamPlayer3Ds, all with AudioStreamSynchronized, each with lots of other simultaneously-playing streams. Each stream had its `volume_db` set to 0, so no volume adjustment was actually applied. Here are the (approximate) measurements of the audio thread from the project's profiler:\r\n\r\nGodot without this PR: **2.1ms**\r\nThis original PR: **2.79ms**\r\nThis PR with these optimizations : **2.15ms**\r\n\r\nWith optimizations, that's approximately a 2.4% increase from where Godot currently is, as opposed to a 32.9% increase with this PR's original code. I should mention that I don't feel these tests were the most accurate, but they definitely get the numbers in the ballpark.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2778467295/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]